{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曹銦玲在TVB節目《死有對証》中挑戰極限！她親身上陣拍攝一場7層樓高的天台危企戲，雖然自認沒有畏高，但站在天台邊緣時仍嚇到腳軟，直言「真係驚」，究竟這場驚心動魄的戲份是如何拍攝完成的？</p><figure><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/24_16068456006ab751dfc27e9-1024x576.jpg\"/><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/34_18667168516ab752081a9ac-1024x576.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>曹銦玲親述7層樓高天台驚魂：望落去真係驚</p><p>在今晚（25日）播出的一集中，曹銦玲將上演一幕驚險的天台戲。她透露自己是首次拍攝天台場口，雖然平時喜歡玩過山車、跳樓機等刺激活動，本身沒有畏高問題，但當真正站在7層樓高的天台邊緣時，恐懼感油然而生。她憶述當時情況：「不過當我企喺天台邊邊位嗰陣，望落去冇Platform（平台），嗰吓真係驚嘅。」真實的恐懼反應，反而讓這場戲的危險感更加逼真，也突顯了演員面對挑戰時的心理壓力。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11_19626993626ab60fdd83183.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>武指綁實威也 曹銦玲扮迷幻似跌非跌</p><p>雖然場面驚險，但劇組做足了安全措施。曹銦玲表示，拍攝時武術指導為她綁緊了威也（鋼絲），給予她十足的安全感：「武指幫我綁威也，同埋拉到我好緊，所以好安全。」然而，這場戲的難度不僅在於高度，更在於表演細節。她需要在天台邊緣一邊走，一邊吸電子煙，同時要做出迷幻、站不穩的「似跌非跌」狀態。為了捕捉最完美的鏡頭，整個拍攝過程耗時至少一個小時，來來回回拍了好幾次，足見其專業精神。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/29_14010779986ab610289e67a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>網民大讚專業：睇見都驚</p><p>這段驚險的幕後花絮曝光後，不少網民都對曹銦玲的敬業態度表示佩服，紛紛留言大讚她為演戲搏命。有網民表示：「睇見都腳軟，演員真係唔易做！」、「為咗效果親身上陣，好專業！」、「7層樓高真係唔係講笑，辛苦晒！」、「好期待今晚呢一幕，一定好緊張！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_18244988536ab60fbdc89d1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/03_9313490076ab60fc137286.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_1200371506ab60fc521d50.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_1274356236ab60fc8f2c10.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06_5950517776ab60fcc7fb32.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_19309563766ab60fcfe4df4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_19907936096ab60fd32b45b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09_13842059536ab60fd6c9f0a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12_2920720846ab60fe0a152c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/13_9003966056ab60fe4708b7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14_9328827776ab60fe7b8f67.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/15_15853018156ab60feb264f5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16_3478204956ab60fee8507d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17_17614348586ab60ff229ddc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/18_13747759676ab60ff81c3a3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19_11585663436ab60ffaed164.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20_2525976196ab60fff9ece3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21_19071873686ab61003ac3c1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30_17979064226ab6102c72d83.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T13:39:07.405001+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":903,"images":23,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}